      "content": "English: Hebrew | French: Hébreu (Hébraique) | Latin: Hebraeus | Origin: &#1506;&#1460;&#1489;&#1456;&#1512;&#1460;&#1497; | Vietnamese: Híp-ri 1 -- chỉ dân Ít-ra-en, St 39,14.17 ; Xh 21,2",
      "kind": "MARK_KIND_FOOTNOTE",
      "label": "34",
      "sortOrder": 33,
      "startOffset": 104,
      "endOffset": 104,
      "createdAt": "2025-09-03T01:12:57.661Z",
